<title>FRANCE: French cocoa bean imports up yr/yr in December.</title>
<headline>French cocoa bean imports up yr/yr in December.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French December cocoa bean imports issued by French customs (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>		     Dec 96     Dec 95     Jan/Dec 96    Jan/Dec 95</p>
<p>     Ivory Coast  7,992	3,422	 67,407	  63,615</p>
<p>     Ghana	    927	  245	 13,978	  15,002</p>
<p>     Nigeria	1,046	  653	 11,634	   5,727</p>
<p>     Cameroon	   0	  295	  9,806	   9,752</p>
<p>     Indonesia	342	  827	  9,610	  10,471</p>
<p>     World total 10,826	6,044	119,840	 113,520</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
